(6626700, 989162, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> I loved this photo, marked it accordingly but did not have time for comments. Did you engage in a conversation with him? What a character! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, he was a trip. I was getting in my car when I noticed him. I actually laughed and quickly said hello and asked for a photograph before he lost the ashes. He loved the attention, and then began to tell me how he cycled through Columbia as a professional photographer. . . smoking of course. Naturally nobody could keep up with him.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: I loved this photo, marked it accordingly but did not have time for comments. Did you engage in a conversation with him? What a character!   Yeah, he was a trip. I was getting in my car when I noticed him. I actually laughed and quickly said hello and asked for a photograph before he lost the ashes. He loved the attention, and then began to tell me how he cycled through Columbia as a professional photographer. . . smoking of course. Naturally nobody could keep up with him.', '2011-12-28 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
