(6626755, 989219, 18197, '<td valign="top">Richard ... scored low because it didn''t match the DPC vibe. Good image, workmanlike, but without sex, drugs, or post over-processing. 500 + entries ... you knew the answer before you posted.<br/> <br/>Still love almost everything you shoot. Keep it up!!!</td>', 'Richard ... scored low because it didn''t match the DPC vibe. Good image, workmanlike, but without sex, drugs, or post over-processing. 500 + entries ... you knew the answer before you posted. Still love almost everything you shoot. Keep it up!!!', '2011-12-28 01:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
