(6627207, 989191, 141738, '<td valign="top">Thanks HarveyG and everyone who commented. I''m not sure most people realize what it takes to get a shot like that. But then again, that''s photography! I was challenged by the council to prove the shot was taken by me and I sent in the original, so I guess that''s kind of a vote in itself. If people can''t believe you really took the shot, then that''s kind of cool too!</td>', 'Thanks HarveyG and everyone who commented. I''m not sure most people realize what it takes to get a shot like that. But then again, that''s photography! I was challenged by the council to prove the shot was taken by me and I sent in the original, so I guess that''s kind of a vote in itself. If people can''t believe you really took the shot, then that''s kind of cool too!', '2011-12-28 17:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
